INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (651, 242, 100212, 'mahasiswa', 'Kezia Denita Alfaridzi', '<p>NIM: 215100301111065</p> <p>Saya merasa kegiatan sejak masuk kuliah sangat monoton walaupun banyak yang harus dikerjakan. Sudah mencoba mencari kegiatan di luar akademik namun saya agak kesulitan karena saya bukan orang yang friendly sehingga teman yang benar-benar dekat hampir tidak ada. </p> <p>Saat di kelas juga beberapa kali ketika saya diminta untuk menanggapi pertanyaan dosen napas saya menjadi tidak beraturan dan tangan gemetar. Untuk case ini tidak selalu muncul dan saya tidak bisa memprediksi kapan saya bisa menjawab dengan tenang dan kapan tidak. <br /></p>', '2022-03-06 16:07:01');
INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (652, 230, 100200, 'mahasiswa', 'Yofy Krisna Damara Cahaya Dewa', '<p>Baik, saya bersedia.</p>', '2022-03-06 16:35:02');
INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (653, 243, 100213, 'mahasiswa', 'Yunike Afina Susana', '<p>NIM: 185070201111012<br /></p> <p>Saya merasa bingung dengan diri saya dan berusaha mencari tahu jawabannya. Saya merasa ada yang tidak "normal" dengan perilaku saya belakangan ini. Tidak nafsu makan atau makan seadanya dan seperlunya. Rasanya hanya ingin tidur dan tidak semangat untuk melakukan apapun. I don''t trust anybody enough to try and seek help to them or even pour my hearts out to them. I really don''t try to talk to anybody. Not even my parents, my sibling nor my close friends. I completely buried my problems and keep it to myself and just trying to breathe through everything. I also deny this "unusual" behavior thinking that it doesn''t matter and keep putting it aside. I''m bugged by those symptoms but what disturbs me the most is, that I seem to *despise* my parents. It''s not like that I don''t love them, nor do I want them to vanish from this world. God oh no. But everytime they''re trying to reach me through calls, I just simply, vanish. I ignore them. Everytime I see a notification on my phone "incoming voice call", I keep saying to myself "why the f- should you ruin my day" or "f- why". I even hate being reached every day. For example I would surrender myself and answer the phone. And then the next day my parents would call me again, I would reaallly hate it and said to myself "f-ing leave me alone". I don''t know what makes me despise them so much. I feel like I''m becoming an ungrateful child. I feel like my whole life has built to become the "golden child" with no flaws that I developed this feeling towards them. So my major concern is this parent issue and what follows are those unmotivated or lazy feeling throughout the days and lastly they affect my academic outcomes.<br /></p>', '2022-03-06 22:57:24');
INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (654, 244, 100214, 'mahasiswa', 'AMARANI THOYIBAH', '<p>205020901111003</p> <p>Sebenernya siapa yang boleh melihat sisi rapuhku? </p>', '2022-03-07 00:37:04');
