INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (1906, 716, 2, 'admin', 'Ulifa Rahma', '<p><strong>Mohon maaf atas balasan yang begitu lama mengingat antrian yang Panjang semoga dimengerti..</strong></p> <p>Saya sangat memahami apa yang Anda rasakan dan hal tersebut bukanlah hal yang mudah, Semoga hari saat <strong>Anda</strong> baca tanggapan ini, kondisinya sudah lebih baik ya.Berikut tips perencanaan karier</p> <p>1. kenali diri, kelebihan dan kekurangan anda, apa yang anda sukai, anda baik dibidang apa dan memiliki kesempatan apa</p><figure><img src="cid:5qgzibufjvlfysdkjcsnxbky0tqwbvwu" data-image="5QgZibUfJvlfysdkJCsNxBKY0TqWbVwU" alt="image" /></figure> <p><strong>2. eksplorasi diri. </strong>Apa yg bisa dilakukan untuk kenali? Ikut psikotes? Analisis personal SWOT? konseling Ikut organisasi?magang? Ikut karir day?</p> <figure style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(51, 51, 51)"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;float:none"><img src="cid:_toxtcoldknfg3rg81xszyxnaqhfhr_c" data-image="_toxtCOldknFg3RG81XSZYXNaQHfhR_c" alt="image" style="box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%" /><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div></figure> <p>3. Refeleksi diri. introspeksi diri, apa yg sudah berkembang, apa yg perlu dikembangkan lgi?</p> <figure style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(51, 51, 51)"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;float:none"><img src="cid:roxjqxgghk6q0bvg-sfhb0vhpeg8ai9c" data-image="rOxJQXGGhK6Q0bVg-SFHb0vHPEg8ai9c" alt="image" style="box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%" /><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;trans