nt;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div></figure> <p>4. Asah dan kembangkan soft skill maupun hard skill yang dibutuhkan dalam bekerja</p> <figure style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(51, 51, 51)"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;float:none"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;position:relative;max-width:100%;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;float:none"><img src="cid:-ye5epqpikhbfs4ls47hjcvp1hwqwb6w" data-image="-YE5EpqPikHBfS4lS47hJCvP1hwQwB6w" alt="image" style="box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%" /><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0px !important;position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:5px;visibility:hidden;opacity:0.5;transition:visibility 0s linear 0s, opacity 0.2s ease-in 0s"></div></div></figure> <p>5. RESEARCH, PAHAMI TREND, KEBUTUHAN DAN TUNTUTAN DUNIA