INSERT INTO ticket_messages (id, ticket_id, sender_id, sender_role, sender_name, body, created_at) VALUES (9836, 2604, 102371, 'mahasiswa', 'Alliya Rahayu', '<p>halo kak ishida!!</p> <p>first of all, thank you for replying this.</p> <p>aku minta maaf ya kak/ibu if im using bad words (tidak baku).</p> <p>1. I probably think what makes me anxiety are my trauma and society. I think i have a social anxiety an it''s really kill me. Social anxiety ini ngebuat aku takut buat expressing my feelings, kadang buat ngomong takut padahal itu gak ada salahnya. Worse, aku jadi gasuka bersosial, apalagi buat join organisasi. Tapi sekarangaku coba untuk join satu organisasi. Dan turns out, anxiety aku makin parah. Hampir setiap hari ada rapat, and it''s draining. Semenjak itu, aku selalu ga tenang buat tidur. I do feel sleepy, tapi bener bener yang gabisa tidur dan aku sesak nafas, dan kadang sampe nangis. Dan itu terjadi setiap hari. I''m tired kak... I cant even escape. </p> <p>Oh ya, cara aku ngatasinnnya adalah i disappear for a while. Aku bisa sampe bengong seharian and doing nothing. Kalau lagi sesak nafas, aku tarik nafas yang dalam, dan kadang aku luapin dengan nangis.<br /></p> <p>2. I can say aku lahir dari keluarga yang cenderung konservatif. My dad is so tempramental. I never feel appreciated since i was a kid. Ayahku suka main fisik, even ke mamah aku, kakak kakakku, dan aku. Aku gapernah bisa express my feelings. Dan it made me takut buat expressing my feelim growing upngs di public. Aku takut ngerasa salah, takut ngerasa dipojokin, dan im totally ngerasa ga nyaman kalau diperhatiin.</p> <p>Im growing up, aku merasa takut buat terbuka ke semua orang. worse, aku merasa ga aman sama laki-laki. Sampai dimana i feel more comfortable to be with girls. I dont know whether it;s because my trauma or im just not interest with boys. Im so sorry if you read this, kak... I hope youre not judging me because im struggling with that. I always feel guilty, like everyday. Wishing me to be normal, again. But it''s difficult. Im struggling with my anxiety, my trauma, and my sexual orientation. Do you think it is wrong to be different? Do you think im disgusting? Why do people being so homophobic? We don''t even bother them.</p> <p>And all my problems bring me feel unworthy. I feel i dont deserve anything. It hurts me. I cant take this anymore. I cant even take my tears while im writing this. If u mind, im sorry kak.</p> <p>3. It does bother me kak. Aku narik diri dari social, i always feel unworthy, i feel i dont deserve anything, dan aku gabisa tidur kak, aplagi akhir akhir ini:(</p> <p>4. I wish this session can heal my trauma.</p>', '2025-03-02 22:07:59');
